    THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

  tfpp/tfpp/load.py, part.py and driver.py (Flash Next, TensorFold 0.6.1), most of tfpp/tfpp/glm/ (TensorFold v0.6.0
  with the MIA patches) and most of tfpp/tfpp/ds41/ (the fork below) contain code adapted from TensorFold, modified by
  the hive-ram contributors: functions cut at a layer range, classes that follow TensorFold's engine constructors
  step by step, and loaders that compile a copy of an installed TensorFold module's source with a few anchored lines
  replaced. TensorFold's MIT notice for code written before 0.6.0 (Copyright (c) 2026 TensorFold contributors) is
  reproduced in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

